// Title: PowerShell Download and Execution Cradles
// Rule ID: 85b0b087-eddf-4a2b-b033-d771fa2b9775
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
